              rdfs:range obo:NCIT_C97325 ;
              obo:IAO_0000115 "A role used to assert that a procedure or technical method requires use of specific artifacts or pieces of equipment. The domain and range for this role are 'Activity' and 'Manufactured Object', respectively." ;
