                 rdfs:subClassOf obo:NCIT_C113122 ;
                 obo:IAO_0000115 "A proprietary blood collection tube for stabilization and isolation of total RNA from whole blood for gene expression analysis. When blood is drawn into the tube and mixed with the proprietary stabilizing reagent, lysis occurs almost immediately. The stabilizing reagent inactivates cellular RNases and selectively precipitates RNA, with genomic DNA and proteins remaining in solution." ;
